# The repo root .gitignore excludes *.sql (V2's local MySQL dump
# convention) -- these are real, versioned SQL sources, not local dumps,
# so they're explicitly un-ignored here.
#
# `database/scripts/` was missing from this list until Phase 2, which is
# why `financial-role-contract.sql` was referenced by a passing test and
# by V3_PHASE1_IMPLEMENTATION.md while never actually being committed.
# Infrastructure SQL that a documented guarantee depends on must be in
# the repository, not only on the machine that ran it.
!database/migrations/**/*.sql
!database/scripts/*.sql
